<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Merrill ups Tanger.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Merrill ups Tanger.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it upgraded Tanger Factory Outlet Centers Inc to a near-term accumulate from neutral, maintaining a long-term accumulate rating on the stock.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
